{% comment %}
Email sign-up for new chapter announcements and big Anno Arcana news, shown
with the follow/support emblems (see comicSocials.liquid): in the left margin
under Bluesky and X on wide screens, or in the emblem row otherwise.
Sign-ups go straight to the Buttondown newsletter (buttondown.com/forscher22),
which sends the confirmation email and handles unsubscribes. It opens in a
new tab so readers keep their place in the comic.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="subscribe">
  <p class="subscribe-title" id="subscribe-title-{{ placement }}">Get an email when a new chapter drops</p>
  <form
    action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/forscher22"
    method="post"
    target="_blank"
    class="subscribe-form"
    aria-labelledby="subscribe-title-{{ placement }}"
  >
    <label for="bd-email-{{ placement }}" class="subscribe-label">Email address</label>
    <input type="email" name="email" id="bd-email-{{ placement }}" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
    <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
  </form>
  <p class="subscribe-privacy">
    Only used for chapter updates and big Anno Arcana news (new issue releases,
    conventions I might be at, etc.), and that is <strong>all</strong>.
    Handled by <a href="https://buttondown.com/refer/forscher22" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buttondown</a>
    (<a href="https://buttondown.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy</a>).
  </p>
</div>
